#==============================================================================================
#
#   display_list_recording_context - Web::DisplayListRecordingContext: what painting records
#   into
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/DisplayListRecordingContext.cpp (lines 1-107) and the
#       inline members of DisplayListRecordingContext.h (lines 1-100): the display list recorder
#       paintables record into, the palette, the device pixel converter and chrome metrics, the
#       device viewport rect, the SVG transform, and the conversions between CSS and device
#       pixels. The C++ holds its recorder by reference; the struct keeps a pointer.
